<title>USA: Armor buys Defense Technology for $1.0 mln.</title>
<headline>Armor buys Defense Technology for $1.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>FERNANDINA BEACH, Fla. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armor Holdings Inc said on Tuesday that it purchased all of the assets of Defense Technology Corp of America for $1.0 million cash, 630,000 shares of common stock and the assumption of certain liabilities.</p>
<p>Defense Technology, which is Casper, Wyoming-based manufacturer and distributor of Less-ThanLethal and Anti-Riot products, reported sales for fiscal 1995 of $11 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
